37,2,1,talk,Victoria,,- **Victoria**: The spectroscopy suite sat idle for eleven weeks. That is a critical gap for any proposal relying on it.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"The ledgers confirm my suspicion: vehicle costs are frozen, but shipping has climbed. The bench-fee subsidy for glasshouses is a rare bright spot.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Benjamin"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Benjamin: The ledgers confirm my suspicion: vehicle costs are frozen, but shipping has climbed. The bench-fee subsidy for glasshouses is a rare bright spot.""}]}"
39,2,1,talk,Midori,,"The repository migration is complete. Deposits now clear in weeks, not months. That removes a major administrative bottleneck for data-heavy projects.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Midori"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Midori: The repository migration is complete. Deposits now clear in weeks, not months. That removes a major administrative bottleneck for data-heavy projects.""}]}"
40,2,2,talk,Shizue,,#### Turn 2 of 4,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,#### Turn 2 of 4,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Benjamin, the glasshouse subsidy is helpful, but the animal facility day rates have risen sharply. That changes the cost calculus for biological work.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Victoria, precisely. Simulation hours are now free, but animal units cost more. The financial risk has shifted entirely to the biology side.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Victoria, that idle spectroscopy suite is worrying. Does that mean we should avoid any proposal relying heavily on that specific equipment?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Shizue,,#### Turn 3 of 4,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,#### Turn 3 of 4,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Midori, not necessarily avoid, but we must price in the risk. One engineer covers three institutes now; reliability is compromised.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Midori, the free simulation hours actually offset that risk. If a proposal leans on computation, the cost is zero, unlike the expensive animal units.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Midori,,"@Benjamin, that’s a fair point. But if the spectroscopy suite is unreliable, even free computation can’t save a project that needs physical measurements.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"@Ryuji, I have reviewed the closeout files. Several mechanism-focused awards ended with their central questions unresolved, while catalogue-style ones still draw users a decade later.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shizue, that aligns with my staffing findings. Trained phenotyping technicians have left for industry, but modelling applicants are arriving in numbers.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"@Ryuji, that staffing shift is critical. The glasshouse crew is intact, but the modelling analysts are seconded abroad until autumn.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"@Ryuji, that secondment is a significant gap. We have the applicants, but not the senior oversight to guide them effectively right now.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Midori,,"@Shizue, that catalogue insight is vital. It suggests we should favor projects with lasting utility over those chasing fleeting mechanistic details.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
